-- RESET to the Morning Market cases (decided 2026-11-27). Generated by
-- scripts/build_mm_seed.py from the case workbook; do not edit by hand.
--
-- Run AFTER migration 20261127_21_min_stock.sql, in the Supabase SQL editor.
-- One transaction: if anything fails, nothing changes.
--   1. Copies every table it empties into schema kpv_backup_20261127.
--   2. Empties, in EVERY branch: documents, transfers, stock days and
--      ledger, cases, case assignments, min/lead rules, SKUs, sizes, types.
